WEBVTT

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.780
There are more anti-00 forces encircling Tundrastar than we anticipated.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.910
Ground forces are also on strict alert.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:22.910
With DES AA controlling the airspace, an attack concert on the <i>Flying Get</i> is too risky.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.670
Our intel was right. DES is not holding back.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.670
Tsubasa-san! We're still going to—

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.340
I know.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.340
We'll find a way to hold this concert, no matter what.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.390
The WOTA stationed here
will lend us their assistance.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:36.760
You can count on us!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.350
We're requesting the cooperation of local supporters.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.850
We're also investigating weak points in their security where you can hold the concert.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.520
Thank you.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.110
Mariko-sama has bestowed her thanks upon us!

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.900
I-I shall lay my life on the line!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.820
After all, I'm a huge Mariko-sama—

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.240
Mariko-sama?

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.040
You are on standby until the concert begins.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.870
Those performing in the main concert, double-check your formation.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:09.380
Stand-ins, please change, put on your makeup, and start warming up.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.170
Okay!

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.880
All right! Show some spirit, girls!

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.300
Takamina, <i>you</i> are to rest.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.140
I'll perform! Don't worry about me!

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.390
I <i>wasn't</i> worrying about you.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:23.520
This concert will be once-in-a-lifetime.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.440
For many in the audience, this will be the first and last time they see 00.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:33.780
Can you give them your best performance right now?

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:37.530
A performance so spectacular, they'll never forget it?

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:40.990
Kanata.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.620
Yes?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:46.000
You will be standing in for Takamina on stage.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.710
You want me... to replace Takamina-san?

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.010
Ready, set, here we go!

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.060
AKB0048!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.730
Come on, Makoto. Isn't that a bit much?

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:34.440
Not really.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:38.030
I'm plain anyway, so I gotta do what I can to stand out.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:38.820
Right?

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.070
Makes sense.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.900
You weren't supposed to agree.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:45.870
Kanata-san!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.660
We're starting the formation check.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:49.330
Got it.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.960
Kanata, don't forget to hustle!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.590
R-Right!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:13.100
I think mauve pink would look better on you.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.690
Mimori-san.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:19.320
This is our first time performing away from Akibastar, after all.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.610
Let's show some spirit!

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:28.080
If I'm not performing with Youko, I can't bring myself to care.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.080
I wanted to become a successor with Youko.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.000
We were always together,

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:41.710
but now Youko's on the main stage,
and I'm just a stand-in on combat duty.

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.800
We've grown so distant.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.100
I wanted to sing by Youko's side.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.690
But you <i>are</i> still by her side.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:05:02.110
Our efforts will help the successors shine at the main concert.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:07.070
We're always connected. We're always together!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:10.740
Mimori-san...

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:15.870
I said such terrible things to you and Kanata-san, so why...

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.420
Why...

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.630
There's no need to worry about that.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.670
After all,

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.550
I'm a masochist!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.090
Whah?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.800
Let's make the most of this!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.300
Okay!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.890
Kanata! You're supposed to move to 0.75.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:35.520
Right!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.610
Lead with your left foot!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.070
Don't move for the sake of moving.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.820
Consider how you'll look.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.490
Yuuko's letting her have it.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.160
It's just tough love.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.330
Granted, this is supposed to just be a formation check.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:56.370
Kanata's dancing pretty well, if you ask me.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.790
Yuuko-san...

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.260
I'm sorry.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:12.560
<i>She really </i>is<i> amazing.</i>

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.280
Is it time yet?

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.160
Makoto-san, your makeup is coming off.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.080
Augh, I practiced too hard!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.660
Snow... man.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.080
What is it?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.290
I wanna make a snowy-man.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:46.800
Right, you come from a desert planet.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.470
So you've never seen snow before?

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.550
Snowy-man.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:53.680
It looks like we still have time, so wanna go outside for a bit?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.390
Are you sure that's a good idea?

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.980
I mean, DES could be out there.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:03.060
Nobody's gonna recognize us. We're still understudies.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.230
We'll call it reconnaissance.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.440
Chieri!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.570
Snowy-man!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.030
I'm coming too!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.030
Snowy-man!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.320
Wait for us!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.120
Shall we join them?

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.080
Sure.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.290
Tsubasa-san.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.870
The understudies have gone outside.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.630
Oh, those girls.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.340
What will I do with them?

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.680
Yay! Snow, snow, snow!

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:37.350
Sonata!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.560
Are you all right?

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.060
Oh dear.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.060
Shakey-shakey-shake.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.480
That didn't hurt!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.240
Chieri, whatcha lookin' at?

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.150
That.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.530
It's a town.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.680
It's kind of gloomy around here.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.760
That old man looks sad.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.140
Maybe it's because of the gray skies.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:23.060
Doesn't this place remind you of Lancastar?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.900
Yes, it does.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.610
It feels so long ago.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.230
Oh my.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.400
What could this line be for?

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.610
Rations?

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.490
It looks like they're giving out bread over there.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.160
Sonata wants a piece!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.750
You shouldn't, Sonati.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.630
Rations are only for those in need.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.670
I see.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.760
Man, you can really sense their melancholy.

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.430
Not a single one of them has a smile on their face.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.680
Yeah.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.220
It's like even their hearts have frozen over.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:05.810
This is what people are like
under the Entertainment Ban.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:11.820
Is holding a concert here really a good idea?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.240
Huh?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:17.820
Once the concert's over, they'll just go back to living under the Ban.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.790
It's like we're giving them hope, only to take it away later.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.000
That's a good point.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.130
But even so, I want them to see this concert!

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.420
Heavy Rotation?

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.600
Hold up!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.280
Those girls...

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:58.240
Oh, we're not here to—

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.080
It's the 77th generation!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:05.120
Mimori from the 75th and Megumi from the 76th, too!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.710
Are you talking about us?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.920
Do you know us?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.210
Yes, of course!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:12.960
Huh?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.880
Um, from this.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.590
It's our promotional video.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:21.510
Yep!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:25.930
This is wonderful! We thought the concert was canceled!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.140
You're really here! It's a dream come true!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:29.810
A dream...

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.320
You all came for the concert, didn't you?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.020
Yeah.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:37.070
I begged my mom to let me.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.780
I saved up all my allowance!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:41.120
I helped out, as well!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.200
My, what a good girl.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.330
I worked really hard, too!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.410
Really?

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:51.790
<i>They're just like how we were back then.</i>

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.420
<i>That's right.</i>

00:10:54.550 --> 00:11:00.300
<i>Our dream was born under a gray sky like this.</i>

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.260
Okay!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.440
<i>I've been waiting, I've been waiting, I've been waiting,</i>

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:12.940
<i>Yes!</i>

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:17.440
<i>I've been waiting, I've been waiting, I've been waiting,</i>

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:17.780
<i>Yes!</i>

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:21.200
<i>For you!</i>

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.360
Nagisa.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:23.320
Sonata, too!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.530
Allow me, too.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:28.250
I pedal my bike with all my might

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:33.960
as I make my way up this hill.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.960
I hadn't thought of that.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:38.710
Even my shirt, blown by the wind,

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:42.430
<i>I only listened to my head and started doubting the concert.</i>

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.840
is only getting in my way.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.300
<i>But Nagisa was different.</i>

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:51.730
I've finally come to terms with how I feel,

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:47.640
Kirara?

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:52.600
Kirara!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:58.070
so I'll be honest from now on.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.770
Go on, hurry!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.570
This is the only path...

00:11:58.690 --> 00:11:59.570
What are you doing?

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.820
Are you with 00?

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.410
Leave these girls alone!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:06.620
Drop your weapons and come quietly.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:09.540
What—

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.750
Girls, do you copy?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.750
Tsubasa-san?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.420
You've convinced me.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:23.300
Our new plan of attack:
multiple coordinated concerts.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.970
Multiple coordinated concerts?

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.280
Is that 00?

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.560
Freeze!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:14.310
How and when did it happen?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.020
What?!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.190
Damn it!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:17.270
Before I realized it

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:20.270
I'd fallen in love.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:26.610
Who knows what triggered it?

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:26.610
Behind us?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:33.370
I can't remember when it started.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.370
It looks like I've been infected

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:39.380
by a heart-shaped virus.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:45.260
No vaccine can save me now.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.340
I find myself unable

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:52.560
The DES forces are being scattered by the stand-ins' coordinated concerts.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.350
to get you off my mind.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:57.190
I can hardly concentrate at all.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:57.190
While they're distracted,
we'll begin the main concert.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:01.150
I thought that it could never, ever happen.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:06.740
But it looks like I'm in love with you.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.910
Damn idols!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.620
My goodness, this is splendid!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.670
The DES troops are in disarray!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.460
Ma—I mean, Tsubasa-san!

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.420
It looks like I've been infected

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.460
Fans have begun to gather secretly at the main venue.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.550
by a heart-shaped virus.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:32.260
No vaccine can save me now.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.680
We're starting in ten minutes.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.720
Roger that!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:35.390
I find myself unable

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.850
First up is "RIVER"!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:35.640
All right!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:38.350
to get you off my mind.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:43.860
I can hardly concentrate at all.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.020
Here's your uniform.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.360
Right!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.530
This is...

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:50.070
I can hardly concentrate at all.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.950
Make her proud out there.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:56.620
<i>I may not be able to fill Takamina-san's shoes,</i>

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.830
<i>but I'm sure I can follow in her footsteps...</i>

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.130
Nagisa!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.010
Right!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.430
They ran this way!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.850
Goddamn 00...

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:16.470
Over there?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:23.110
I'm riding on a seesaw of tears,

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:36.830
Chieri...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.540
Gosh. Keep it together.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:41.000
I'm riding on a seesaw of tears...

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.120
Thanks!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.760
<i>This is exciting.</i>

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.260
<i>Wearing this outfit, it's as if Takamina-san is with me.</i>

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.050
<i>I feel like I can do anything.</i>

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:54.800
Showtime!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.760
Okay!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.260
Oh, right!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.100
Wait!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.600
Takamina!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.980
You shouldn't be here! You should be resting!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:03.850
Takamina-san?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.610
I'm fine now.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.030
Take that off!

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:12.110
That's <i>my</i> uniform!

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:13.860
<i>I'm</i> going to be performing in the concert!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:15.990
Takamina.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:17.370
Please, let me do this!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.330
I promise I won't make a fool of myself!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:28.090
As Takahashi Minami the 5th, I'll give the people of this planet the performance of a lifetime!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.340
Very well. Be ready in two minutes.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.220
Thank you so much!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.270
Kanata.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.480
O-Okay.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.370
Whoa~ So many people.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.460
It's just as the understudies promised!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:10.460
AKB0048!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.510
The main performance has just begun.

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:19.430
To keep DES on their toes, find some of the others and continue your mission.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:25.100
The members in your area are:
Chieri, Nagisa, Orine, and Yuuka.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:27.520
Nagisa!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.560
Let's put on a concert!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:37.660
AKB0048!

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.630
Onwards! Onwards!

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:52.920
Straight on Ahead!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.550
Cross that river!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.260
Our dreams always

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.600
seem so far off.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:07.730
It feels like I'll never make it.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.230
Pick up a stone

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.650
lying by your feet.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:12.610
Here we go!

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:13.570
Okay!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.230
Throw caution to the wind

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:17.360
and hurl it!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:20.870
Before your eyes,

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.410
there flows a river:

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:27.870
A wide and vast river.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:31.250
It may be deep and dark,

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:35.050
and the current may be strong,

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:39.130
but don't fear.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.220
If it carries you away,

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:45.560
the other shore will catch you.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:54.110
Have faith in yourself.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:03.120
Don't make excuses!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:08.080
You won't know until you try!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.000
She's just too cool.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:11.250
We have to keep going!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.040
Keep on, keep on, keep on

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.170
walking along

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.880
the path you chose!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:20.180
Within your heart,

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:22.050
there flows a river:

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:26.600
A river of sweat and tears!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:29.640
Even if you fail,

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:33.730
even if you're washed away,

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.730
just try again.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.900
Don't falter now.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:44.030
Hang on to your dreams

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:51.500
until the day they come true.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:45.030
Crap!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.670
Cross that river!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:18.730
<i>In a tiny town, beneath skies of gray,</i>

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.070
<i>a dream was born.</i>

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:25.570
<i>The four of us vowed to join 00.</i>

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:29.330
We first met

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:32.040
two years ago.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:35.130
<i>Our young hearts dared to dream big.</i>

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.290
All of us were chasing

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.000
the same dream.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.420
Our ages

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.970
<i>And now, our dream...</i>

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.970
and the towns where we lived

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.930
were different

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:49.350
<i>...is, little by little, coming true.</i>

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.680
for all seventeen of us.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:53.270
I couldn't fit in

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.350
or make conversation.

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:59.110
I felt so lonely

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:02.650
those first few months.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:05.360
But after enduring

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:08.410
those tough lessons

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.790
side-by-side with the others,

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:14.580
I realized.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:20.920
My friends are always

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.590
right by my side.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:28.510
I'll never be all alone.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.890
Together,

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:35.440
our eyes are fixed on that star.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:39.900
Having everyone there for me

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:45.450
is what gave me strength.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:22:00.170
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:03.630
Takamina-san!

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:04.800
Kanata—

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:07.590
Takamina!

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:08.800
Takamina-san!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:11.720
Kanata...

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:13.010
You're burning hot.

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.230
Kanata, take her to the sick bay at once.

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:17.020
Got it.

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:17.690
Take care of her.

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:19.810
Th-They're calling for an encore...

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:21.440
Takamina-san!

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.900
Idiot! At times like these you
should trust your friends!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:25.820
I'm going!

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:27.320
But—

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:32.490
I had no idea you were this close to your limit.

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.040
Okay! Listen up!

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.790
We need to put on an encore
that'll make Takamina proud!

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.090
Yeah!

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:45.800
It was amazing. A truly spectacular performance.

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:47.470
Kanata...

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:58.270
I don't have the right to wear your uniform yet.

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:00.310
Still, I'll do my best!

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:05.860
Someday, I'll catch up to you.

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:13.870
I'm not going to make it easy for you.

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.580
<i>She should be bitter.</i>

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:27.210
<i>But no matter how much it hurts her,
she puts 00 and the performance first.</i>

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.680
<i>I guess Takahashi Minami...</i>

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:35.260
<i>the name of Takamina...</i>

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:43.610
<i>should belong to Kanata.</i>

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:48.490
We're having a gravure photo shoot this weekend.

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:50.590
I can smell the sea salt!

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:53.450
My breasts... My breasts!

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.500
What's wrong, Grumbly? Are you dying?

00:23:55.500 --> 00:24:00.000
In that case, I shall lend you my help.

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.000
- The Miracle of the Waves-
